msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Urgh... gah... Why didn't you take the 200,000 and buy yourself the real "
"deal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"Urgh... gah... Why didn't you take the 100,000 and buy yourself the real "
"deal? That was a bargain, dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Why are you so obsessed with this bag, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "...Look for yourself. There should be car keys in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Car keys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Huh. So they are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty deep in debt, y'see. They got me working as... a mule, I guess "
"you'd call me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Some guys in the biz asked me to put the car keys in the bag, then give it "
"to somebody who'd come to buy it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "And, well... turns out you weren't the guy I was waiting for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "So that's what this is about..."
msgstr "Oh, ecco di cosa si tratta..."

msgctxt "264"
msgid "I'd be in real trouble if I lost those keys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Here you go. All yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Are... Are you serious? You're just gonna give them back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Long as you stay out of trouble from now on. Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Thanks so much! Oh, man, I really owe you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"In fact... why don't you take this? It's not much, but I gotta thank you "
"somehow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "396"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "420"
msgid "And you can have this, too. Don't worry⑬this one's real. Honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>French Handbag<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "Grazie."

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Okay, I better get going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Actually... I think I'll hold onto them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"But why!? I told you how much trouble I'd be in without those keys! Do you "
"want them to kill me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"Hey, it comes with the territory. You knew the risks going in, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "You're gonna pay for this!"
msgstr "La pagherai per questo!"

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Now I gotta skip town... Need to find some way out of Kamurocho, and fast..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"But first, some friendly advice: Stay away from the car in front of the "
"Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Return the Keys"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Keep Them"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5440"
msgid "Shady Salesman"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5444"
msgid "Talk_No"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5448"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5452"
msgid "Talk_Yes"
msgstr ""

